{
  "_comment": "better-coding hooks 注册模板（Windows；组件版本以 .qoder/harness-profile.json 的 skillVersion 为准，本文件不复制版本号）。全部 hook 只有一个可执行入口：node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs（注册表：.qoder/hooks/hook-registry.md）。契约：stdin JSON 输入；exit 2 阻断。门禁 hook 通过 if 精确匹配 git 命令。",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook block-dangerous",
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "if": "Bash(git commit*)",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook pre-commit-lint",
            "timeout": 60
          },
          {
            "_comment": "全量测试耗时较长时可改为后台模式：增加 \"asyncRewake\": true 与 \"rewakeMessage\" 字段",
            "type": "command",
            "if": "Bash(git push*)",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook pre-push-test",
            "timeout": 60
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "if": "Bash(git merge*)",
            "async": true,
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook pre-merge-review",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_comment": "选择卡契约 v10 守卫（配套规则 .qoder/rules/ask-card-option-quality）。默认警告模式：exit 0 + additionalContext 注入提醒；设环境变量 ASK_CARD_GUARD_BLOCK=1 切硬阻断（stderr + exit 2，劣质卡片不渲染）。纯确定性启发式 H1-H7 + H10-H13，无 LLM/文件IO/网络",
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook ask-card-guard",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "_comment": "sync-detector 从 UserPromptSubmit 改挂本事件：按 tool_input.file_path 直接判定新文档/规格漂移，不再每轮 git status 猜测（§7.6）",
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook post-edit-format",
            "timeout": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook audit-log",
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook sync-detector",
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "_comment": "v9.8.0 S5：交付物一落盘就把磁盘事实登记进 profile 并宣告「定稿自动成立、3 步同步不等用户口令」。只写 maturity.mrd/prd 与 history，刻意不写 knownDocs / lastSyncAt / footer / 面板（坏处逐条见 .qoder/hooks/hook-registry.md）",
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook auto-finalize",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook audit-log",
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "asyncRewake": true,
            "rewakeMessage": "Harness 校验未通过，请处理以下问题后再结束会话",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook stop-verify",
            "timeout": 120
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook audit-log",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "_comment": "心跳证明 hook 通道在跑：rules.stamp 的集合差断言必须先确认心跳存在，否则 stamp 为空分不清「规则没加载」与「hook 没注册」。session-start-context 直接挂本事件（E12，旧版 UserPromptSubmit + once 的绕路写法已废除）",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs heartbeat",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs hook session-start-context",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "InstructionsLoaded": [
      {
        "_comment": "规则层自证通道：宿主每加载一个指令/规则文件即触发，写 .qoder/logs/rules.stamp。未注册时该事件整体不发 → stamp 缺失 ≠ 规则没加载（§1.7）。payload 键名为 file_path/memory_type/load_reason，不是 source/loadReason",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node .qoder/scripts/harness.mjs rules-stamp",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
